# Authentication

Argon2id hashes. PostgreSQL sessions. No OAuth. TOTP required at first-run.
Recovery codes are hashed and single-use. Password change revokes other
sessions and keeps the current session. Sessions have idle and absolute
expiry, a configurable cap, and Settings revoke. Recovery remaining is
count-only; rotate requires TOTP and shows codes once.
